<title>UK: Chi Cheung sets $30 mln convertible bond.</title>
<headline>Chi Cheung sets $30 mln convertible bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced</p>
<p>by lead manager Daiwa Securities (HK) Ltd.</p>
<p> BORROWER   CHI CHEUNG INVESTMENT CO LTD</p>
<p> AMT    $30 MLN	 COUPON     4.0	 MATURITY  **18.JUN.02</p>
<p> TYPE   CONERTIBLE    ISS PRICE  PAR	 PAY DATE    18.JUN.97</p>
<p> LISTING    LUX	 DENOMS (K) 1,000</p>
<p> NOTES	CALLABLE AFTER THREE YEARS SUBJECT TO 140 PCT RULE</p>
<p>		PUT OPTION 18.JUN.00 AT 116.37</p>
<p>		CONVERTIBLE INTO SHARES OF CHI CHEUNG INVESTMENTS</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
